actions as tax-related (confirmed earlier via IX-17). The Tax Summary page (year=2024) correctly aggregates all 18 tax-related transactions, showing Total Taxable Income ($47,592.50), Total Deductible Expenses ($36,485.99), Net Taxable Income ($11,106.51), category breakdowns with percentages, and a full list of tax-related transactions matching the entered data.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filter 'Rent' returned only the 2 Rent transactions; date range filter From=2024-12-01 To=2024-12-10 returned exactly the 7 transactions dated within that window (Dec 1-10, 2024), with totals recalculated to match. Filtered results strictly matched selected criteria.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking 'Add Expense' with all fields empty did not create a record; the dialog remained open with focus moved to the Description field, indicating required-field validation blocked submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Future-dated transactions are accepted\", \"actual\": \"Set transaction date to 2027-01-01 (future relative to current date 2026-09-02), submitted the Add Transaction form, and it was accepted without error. New row 'Jan 1, 2027 QA Future Date Test Software — -$25.00' appears in the transactions table and Total Expenses updated to -$36,510.99, confirming no validation prevents future dates.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No validation prevents start date being after end date\", \"actual\": \"Set From=2024-12-10 and To=2024-12-01 (start later than end) in the Transactions date filter. The system did not show any validation error or block the input; it silently displayed 'No transactions found' with no indication that the date range itself was invalid.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After adding a new $500 'QA Realtime Income Test' Income transaction on the Transactions page and navigating to Dashboard, Monthly Income updated from $0 to $500, Net Profit/Loss updated to $500, and the transaction appeared at the top of 'Recent Transactions' — confirming the dashboard reflects new data without manual refresh.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Toggling the 'Tax Related' switch on in the Edit Transaction dialog and saving caused the transaction row's Tax column to update from empty to a checkmark (✓), providing clear visual feedback that the item is now marked tax-related.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each category card on the Categories page displays the count of assigned transactions (e.g., 'Sales Revenue — 3 transactions', 'Rent — 2 transactions') and a running Total dollar amount for that category, confirming custom/existing categories correctly show already-assigned records.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On the Tax Summary page, clicking the 'Print Report' button invokes the browser's native window.print() function (verified via a monkey-patched window.print that recorded __printCalled=true after the click), which triggers the OS/browser print dialog/print destination selection menu as expected.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Spending/expenditure details are visible across multiple views: Dashboard 'Expenses by Category' pie chart and 'Monthly Expenses' card; Categories page listing each expense category with transaction count and running total (e.g., Salaries $25,000, Rent $4,400); Tax Summary 'Deductible Expenses by Category' table showing amount and % of total per category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\